[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_t53vw")
dialogue_id = "debate_weird_lifestyles"
record_title = "Debate Speech: The Wild People"
text = "PAGE: historian(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
historian: I have recently read a report about a shard that completely refused to civilize.
historian: They live in caves and hollows, refusing to ever fell a tree or break a stone.
historian: If this shard was a province in a unified world, it would be a complete nightmare.
historian: You can't collect taxes from a commune that has no private property.
historian: You can barely even reach them without roads, which they'd refuse to build.
historian: A central state would have to force these forest dwellers to assimilate.
historian: But today, these people have the freedom to live in a way that perfectly matches their own conscience, and those that choose a different path are just a gate hop away from a thousand different lifestyles to pick from."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
